```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner enroll --help
Enroll a protected runner credential

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner enroll [OPTIONS] --config <PATH>

Options:
      --activation-file <PATH|->  Read the activation artifact from a protected file or explicit stdin
      --resume                    Resend the exact unresolved enrollment journal
      --replace-credential        Stage the enrolled credential as a replacement for this runner
      --config <PATH>             Read the closed runner operator configuration
      --json                      Print the non-secret enrollment result as JSON
  -h, --help                      Print help

```
